<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-BP raised to &quot;buy&quot; at CSFB.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-BP raised to &quot;buy&quot; at CSFB.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Petroleum Co Plc was raised to a &quot;buy&quot; from a &quot;hold&quot; at CS First Boston, the investment bank said on Monday.</p>
<p>Analysts at CSFB said BP's shares had recently lagged other international oil stocks, adding that it had relatively little exposure to the chemical sector which they believe is due for a downturn in the second half of the year.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
</text>
